Note: `config/deploy.production.yml`, `.github/workflows/deploy-production.yml`, `bin/migrate-database-to-new-prod` and `bin/verify-migration` all still point at the obsolete `146.59.44.70` and must be repointed to `51.255.38.227` (ask first, deploy config) once SSH works. A push to `main` would deploy to `146.59.44.70`, not to the live server. Update this section when the migration happens.

